#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:1
#: ecf1afc9871c42aba4ab9f26f673383d
msgid "能量基线平移（Energy Baseline Shift）"
msgstr "Energy Baseline Shift"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:3
#: e7705df816ea45ddb4bc87960efc6d23
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:5
#: 6f56d98ad322445bb4b33489ec13fbeb
msgid ""
"按元素计数拟合原子参考能，并从结构总能量中减去对应基线。适合统一不同 `Config_type` "
"或不同组成数据的能量零点，便于比较形成能附近的变化。"
msgstr ""
"Fit atomic reference energies from element counts and subtract the resulting "
"baseline from each structure's total energy. This is useful for placing data "
"with different `Config_type` values or compositions on a consistent energy "
"zero, so variations near the formation energy can be compared."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:8
#: 23a476b907104c44b376a7511a2feba0
msgid ""
"这个操作会修改当前结构的 energy。第一次平移前的数值会写入 `energy_original`； "
"同一结构再次平移时不会覆盖已经保存的原始能量。"
msgstr ""
"This operation modifies the current structures' energy values. Before the "
"first shift, the original value is saved to `energy_original`; applying "
"another shift to the same structure does not overwrite the saved original."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:11
#: ce4986b87b6a4f77a28ce420708e05e2
msgid "拟合与平移原理"
msgstr "Fitting and shift method"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:13
#: edf9d0640dce40eb90151308aff1af65
msgid ""
"设结构 $i$ 的元素计数向量为 $\\mathbf n_i$，待拟合的逐元素基线为 $\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g$，其中 "
"$g$ 是由 `分组规则`匹配到的 `Config_type` 组。 程序用自然进化策略（NES）最小化"
msgstr ""
"For structure $i$, let $\\mathbf n_i$ be its element-count vector and "
"$\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g$ the per-element baseline to fit, where $g$ is the "
"`Config_type` group selected by `Grouping rule`. The program uses a natural "
"evolution strategy (NES) to minimize"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:17
#: 9bd5d2e19e4a4103bf05dc8baf73a431
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal L_g=\n"
"\\frac{1}{|g|}\\sum_{i\\in g}\n"
"\\left[E_i^{\\mathrm{DFT}}-\\mathbf n_i^\\mathsf T\n"
"\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g-T_i\\right]^2,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal L_g=\n"
"\\frac{1}{|g|}\\sum_{i\\in g}\n"
"\\left[E_i^{\\mathrm{DFT}}-\\mathbf n_i^\\mathsf T\n"
"\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g-T_i\\right]^2,\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:24
#: aae29c1ad85c44888e1f6c6b359bac91
msgid "然后写回"
msgstr "The shifted energy is then written as"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:26
#: 1a46ca6790314b62a000a62337319221
msgid ""
"\n"
"E_i^{\\mathrm{new}}=E_i^{\\mathrm{DFT}}\n"
"-\\mathbf n_i^\\mathsf T\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E_i^{\\mathrm{new}}=E_i^{\\mathrm{DFT}}\n"
"-\\mathbf n_i^\\mathsf T\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g.\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:31
#: e3cbe72ba7be47d3881bacde8b0e3d9d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这里 $\\varepsilon_{g,e}$ 的单位是 eV/atom，$\\mathbf n_i^\\mathsf "
"T\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g$ 是结构总能量基线，单位 eV。三种`对齐方式`只改变目标 $T_i$："
msgstr ""
"Here $\\varepsilon_{g,e}$ is measured in eV/atom, while $\\mathbf "
"n_i^\\mathsf T\\mathbf\\varepsilon_g$ is the structure's total-energy "
"baseline in eV. The three `Alignment mode` choices change only the target "
"$T_i$:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 6c78ad42996146f4beee7567dbbae9fb
msgid "对齐方式"
msgstr "Alignment mode"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 39547c9fff1a4ab1a27873182f47c517
msgid "目标 $T_i$"
msgstr "Target $T_i$"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: e9db7807bcd94ff6b2fc7a9ad06bc7b2
msgid "适合用途"
msgstr "Use case"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 0d26e0921512402da25aa7cdb2124fb7
msgid "`参考组`"
msgstr "`Reference group`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: e51a87393afe4d9bb67fe346a3b3cd0d
msgid "当前选中参考结构的平均总能量"
msgstr "Mean total energy of the selected reference structures"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 0f89dfe8d2014a349b76d78dbe052627
msgid "把不同组对齐到用户指定参考零点"
msgstr "Align different groups to a user-selected reference zero"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: a0043e446a5c43b2bcc2ce4cb3feac30
msgid "`零基线`"
msgstr "`Zero baseline`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 16e0547ecd6941f295715eb48fd84373
msgid "$0$"
msgstr "$0$"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 743921e93a24414ebccd2d3b73535d79
msgid "去掉逐元素线性基线，观察剩余相对能量"
msgstr "Remove the linear per-element baseline and inspect the residual relative energies"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: e2980bd04b8f4701b2a8f2ddbf1baff5
msgid "`DFT 对齐 NEP`"
msgstr "`Align DFT to NEP`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 1d3c42e083144f50a07cab55c005de8e
msgid "$E_i^{\\mathrm{NEP}}$"
msgstr "$E_i^{\\mathrm{NEP}}$"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md
#: 55044151862b465da13a622861adcdef
msgid "让平移后的 DFT 总能量尽量贴合 NEP 总能量"
msgstr "Make the shifted DFT total energies follow the NEP total energies as closely as possible"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:40
#: badd23ce766440ebab42fab108a293f9
msgid ""
"`DFT 对齐 NEP`会把界面中的 NEP 每原子能量乘以原子数后再作为总能量目标。 `最大迭代代数`、`种群大小`和`收敛容差`控制 NES "
"搜索，不改变上述目标函数。"
msgstr ""
"`Align DFT to NEP` multiplies the NEP energy per atom shown in the interface "
"by the atom count before using it as the total-energy target. `Maximum "
"generations`, `Population size`, and `Convergence tolerance` control the NES "
"search without changing the objective above."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md:43
#: 4fe05e3bcb5a4354bd4f8c55b2dd248a
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

