msgstr "Preset area: `Baseline preset`, plus the import, export, and delete buttons."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8105
#: b817bf9478684229b3bee763937ef18b
msgid "参数区：`分组规则`、`对齐方式`、`最大迭代代数`、`种群大小`、`收敛容差`。"
msgstr "Parameter area: `Grouping rule`, `Alignment mode`, `Maximum generations`, `Population size`, and `Convergence tolerance`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8106
#: 2db4b93e69304608985f0df3393bc66f
msgid "保存区：`保存为基线预设`和`预设名称`。"
msgstr "Save area: `Save as baseline preset` and `Preset name`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8107
#: d0ef6a2b15cd4faa848985aaac021fad
msgid "执行结果：后台拟合/应用基线平移并重绘。"
msgstr "Result: fit and apply the baseline shift in the background, then redraw the plot."

